# The installed system tests/install-generations boots (SYS-001 installer
# v2): its root (@ufs:0, @system) holds the development disk's files, the
# storehouse and generation 1; procmgr applies the current generation
# before this plan runs. A desktop: the installed disk must reach it.
(startup v1
  (start "logstore.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "clock.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "display.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "desktop.svc" (priority 4))
)
